142 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Battery Management System, also known as BMS, is the most crucial system in the entire lithium-ion power delivery system.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
143 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The BMS has a variety of tasks, both while charging and while supplying power to the motor and other components.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (While charging, the BMS needs to ensure that all the cells are)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (being charged at the same rate without overheating and preventing excessive current.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (While supplying power i.e. discharging, the BMS manages the temperature and protects the cells from exceeding their maximum voltage.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
