164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our drivetrain is comprised of a simple system, however, it is a very intricate system. It involves extensive research and development to design an effective drivetrain with minimum energy losses and maximizing reliability.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our drivetrain comprises of a simple chain drive to ensure the the speed and torque at the wheels is exactly what we need. A transmission is not required as )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
