179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We are excited to officially inaugurate the Department of Sustainability at AUS Racing. As a Formula Student team, we understand the significance of sustainability in engineering and aim to incorporate responsible practices in every aspect of our project.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The new department will focus on integrating sustainable strategies into our design and manufacturing processes, such as optimizing material selection, minimizing waste, and reducing the carbon footprint of our car. By adopting these principles from the early design stages, we strive to build an electric race-car that is also environmentally responsible.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
181 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Additionally, the Department of Sustainability will work to promote awareness within the team and our wider community, highlighting how engineering can align with environmental values. Through team initiatives and outreach, they will lead efforts to champion sustainability in our project and inspire others.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We look forward to seeing how this department will help AUS Racing set new standards, combining technical excellence with a commitment to a greener future.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
